@startuml SEQ_07_MENGAJUKAN_PERMOHONAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-07: Mengajukan Permohonan Pengadaan

actor       "Asisten"                  as Asisten
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "InventarisController" as Controller
entity      "PermohonanAset Model"     as ModelPA
entity      "PermohonanItem Model"     as ModelPI
database    "permohonan_aset"          as DB

== Ajukan Permohonan Baru ==

Asisten -> Browser     : Ajukan Permohonan
Browser -> Controller  : POST /inventaris/permohonan\n{judul, keterangan, items[]}
Controller -> ModelPA  : create\n({judul, keterangan, status})
ModelPA -> DB          : INSERT INTO permohonan_aset
DB      --> ModelPA    : Data permohonan baru
ModelPA --> Controller : Data permohonan baru
Controller -> ModelPI  : create per item\n({permohonan_id, nama_aset, qty})
ModelPI -> DB          : INSERT INTO permohonan_items
DB      --> ModelPI    : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Asisten    : Permohonan baru dengan status 'Pending'

== Lihat Status Permohonan Sendiri ==

Asisten -> Browser     : Buka menu Permohonan (lihat riwayat)
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/permohonan
Controller -> ModelPA  : Query permohonan milik asisten
ModelPA -> DB          : SELECT permohonan_aset WHERE user_id = ?
DB      --> ModelPA    : Data permohonan
ModelPA --> Controller : Data permohonan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman permohonan
Browser --> Asisten    : Tampil status permohonan

@enduml
